# Install residue and generated lockfiles.
#
# `templates/package.json` is a TEMPLATE, not a manifest this repository
# installs from: `bootstrap-afk.sh` copies it into a target and then runs
# `npm install --package-lock-only` THERE to generate that target's own
# lockfile. Nothing in this repository reads a lockfile under `templates/`,
# and `templates/package-lock.json` was never tracked.
#
# The entries are path-specific on purpose. A bare `package-lock.json` or
# `node_modules/` would cover the same files here, but it would also ignore
# those paths everywhere else in the tree — including anywhere they might one
# day be a real artifact of this repository. Ignoring a path is a claim about
# what that path is; make the claim where it is true.
templates/node_modules/
templates/package-lock.json
